Z||000026||AL||10-18-1999||12:00 AM||||EXCUSE ME GUYS BUT IF YOU ASK ANY OLD TIMER, MECHANIC THEY WILL TELL YOU THAT TRANNY FLUID IS THE ONLY THING THEY USE. ALSO LEAVING IT IN THER FOR A WEEK DOESN;T DO NOTHING TO THE ENGINE IT ONLY CLEANS IT BETTER. FOR THOSE THAT WANT TO DO THIS PUT IN TE TRANNY FLUID RECOMENDED FOR YOUR CAR, ALSO PUT IN ABOUT HALF A BOTTLE OF IT.ALSO IF YOU THINK THIS IS CRAZY THEN ANY ONE KNOWS THAT SLUDGE DOESN'T GET CLEANED BY LETTING YOUR CAR IDLE FOR FIFTEEN MINUTES YOU HAVE TO LEAVE IT IN THER TO CLEAN IT COMPLETE.ASK YOUR MECHANIC AND YOU MIGHT GET EDUCATED A BIT.GOOD LUCK ON YOUR CLEANING. ||||reg||1
